  "description": "Opens and writes password-encrypted Office files for DocWright: ECMA-376 agile encryption read and written (AES-256 and SHA-512 by default, as Word writes it), ECMA-376 standard encryption and legacy Word 97 RC4 and RC4 CryptoAPI read, plus the Office password-hash algorithms. Knows no document model, so Word documents (DocWright) and Excel workbooks (DocWright.Spreadsheet.Security) share it. Uses only the .NET base class library. Digital signatures are a separate package, DocWright.Signatures.",
